1
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,020
Oh, dude!

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,997
Now I'm all covered in soup!

3
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:07,057
Well, it ain't fit for eating, is it?

4
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,300
Why not wear it?

5
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:10,470
Hehehehe!

6
00:00:10,553 --> 00:00:12,200
Bring out another barrelful!

7
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,140
We'll have a food fight!

8
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,960
Pour some over here!

9
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,580
There's plenty of food here!

10
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:27,657
No reason for anyone in Wano to go hungry!

11
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,600
So why do you idiots have all of it?

12
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:12,957
Thank

13
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:14,357
you

14
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:21,440
so

15
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,110
much for watching.

16
00:01:53,620 --> 00:01:55,860
Dream it out

17
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:08,270
Whoa!

18
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,500
This guy is a freak!

19
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:20,520
He's really into that soup.

20
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,720
Kinda weird.

21
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:25,840
Whoa! This guy is a freak!

22
00:02:28,140 --> 00:02:29,760
Yeah, it's damn good!

23
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:33,100
Nothing in the whole world
tastes as sweet as this!

24
00:02:40,580 --> 00:02:42,480
You don't even want this!

25
00:02:42,660 --> 00:02:46,580
Why do you get to have it
while Tomo goes hungry?!

26
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:06,140
Help!

27
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:07,160
Help the gun!

28
00:03:08,180 --> 00:03:09,010
What?

29
00:03:09,093 --> 00:03:10,540
Help the gun!

30
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,840
Hey, Captain, look.

31
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:44,560
Damn Straw Hats!

32
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:47,172
The moron can't even follow his own plan!

33
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:49,520
I thought we were avoiding fights.

34
00:03:49,740 --> 00:03:52,877
Isn't that the whole reason
why we're wearing disguises?

35
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:53,790
Whatever.

36
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:55,470
Kid!

37
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,820
Let him be.

38
00:03:57,240 --> 00:04:01,960
If the idiot wants to make a scene, that
makes it easier for us to pass through.

39
00:04:12,420 --> 00:04:13,580
What the hell?

40
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,440
I couldn't resist, huh?

41
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:48,080
You really made a mess down here.

42
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:54,960
I follow the chaos, and what do
you know, it leads straight to you.

43
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:57,520
Oh, what the hell, Luffy?

44
00:04:58,420 --> 00:05:00,020
You're gonna get us killed!

45
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:02,880
You can't do anything quietly, can you?

46
00:05:03,460 --> 00:05:04,290
Unreal.

47
00:05:04,460 --> 00:05:07,400
Is this how it goes every
time with those fools?

48
00:05:11,140 --> 00:05:12,840
Do you know what they did?

49
00:05:15,900 --> 00:05:17,140
See that soup?

50
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:19,140
They wasted it all for a laugh.

51
00:05:19,780 --> 00:05:20,960
Red bean soup.

52
00:05:21,340 --> 00:05:24,260
I had no idea that food
could taste so good!

53
00:05:26,540 --> 00:05:30,080
If that's the case, I'll
have to cut them to shreds.

54
00:05:36,540 --> 00:05:38,580
What do we got going on here?

55
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:43,520
All that for soup?

56
00:05:43,860 --> 00:05:45,720
Any idea why they got so angry?

57
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,680
That crew is hopeless.

58
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,580
I can't work with them.

59
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:53,685
Well, crap, think they're
going to notice this.

60
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:58,817
We got all those guys riled up way before
the final battle's supposed to start.

61
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:02,600
Maybe that's true, but it's not
like they know who we are yet.

62
00:06:03,180 --> 00:06:06,180
Well, you satisfied now? Yep.

63
00:06:07,060 --> 00:06:08,480
And so am I.

64
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:09,757
Let's get out of here!

65
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:10,670
Yeah!

66
00:06:10,900 --> 00:06:12,140
They're running away!

67
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,080
After them!

68
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:18,740
What's all that noise?

69
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:21,335
Don't tell me someone started a fight.

70
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:26,450
Hmm.

71
00:06:26,533 --> 00:06:27,620
Wait a second. Uh-oh.

72
00:06:36,100 --> 00:06:37,800
A-p-poo, chicken!

73
00:06:39,260 --> 00:06:40,120
You clean!

74
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:41,477
Stop screwing around!

75
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,997
We got something going down!

76
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:44,198
Do you feel myself?

77
00:06:44,540 --> 00:06:46,617
Yo, yo, yo, I'm poo. I'm poo.

78
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:47,877
Tell me what I gotta do.

79
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:49,037
What are we going through?

80
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,317
Something's really bugging you.

81
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:51,237
Lay it on me straight.

82
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:52,496
Now that's your cue.

83
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,740
That voice.

84
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,310
Check it out!

85
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:02,320
With Udon under your supervision,
no one escapes your prison!

86
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:07,300
The rats were locked up
tight, no hope in sight.

87
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:12,300
Check out that brat wearing the Straw Hat!

88
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,310
Huh?

89
00:07:17,393 --> 00:07:18,223
Wanna fight?

90
00:07:20,020 --> 00:07:22,877
There's no forgetting that face,
you must have wrecked the place!

91
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:25,548
Turned your labor camp
into a damn disgrace!

92
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:33,540
The hell!

93
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,340
Face the facts!

94
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,715
They made a comeback!

95
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:58,380
Straw Hat loopy kicking alive!

96
00:07:58,660 --> 00:08:00,660
Pirate hunter Sorrow in overdrive!

97
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:06,120
So he broke out of prison after all.

98
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:07,877
This is the Chief Warden.

99
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:09,920
It seems we finally got through.

100
00:08:10,260 --> 00:08:13,025
I just called to let you
know that all is well.

101
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:20,880
Before you party, do me a favor.

102
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:25,181
Catch those suckers, make it quick,
before they pull a dirty trick.

103
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:31,660
I see, I see, but if I make them
history, what the hell's that do for me?

104
00:08:32,140 --> 00:08:36,340
Now that you mention it, there's
someone I'm about to get rid of.

105
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:40,420
Ah, a Toby Robo.

106
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:09,877
They're gonna have a vacant
slot in their lineup,

107
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:12,900
so whoever catches those
rats gets a promotion.

108
00:09:20,380 --> 00:09:22,120
The Tobi Ropo, huh?

109
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:25,478
If that doesn't motivate
you, I don't know what will.

110
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:30,020
This one is mine.

111
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,220
That must be Kaido's tower.

112
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,271
Don't get stuck fighting.

113
00:09:42,420 --> 00:09:43,457
We need to push through.

114
00:09:43,540 --> 00:09:44,370
Got it!

115
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:01,817
These guys are a little
tougher, aren't they?

116
00:10:01,900 --> 00:10:04,040
They're slowing us down. Uh-huh.

117
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:06,869
I think they've all
got smile fruit powers.

118
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:28,540
You're gonna feel my fightin'
music, Scratch! Scratch!

119
00:10:37,880 --> 00:10:39,740
Luffy! What the?

120
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:41,060
Someone punched me?

121
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:47,300
Wait, I know that guy.

122
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,579
I think he used to be Jaggy's ally.

123
00:10:52,020 --> 00:10:52,850
Slash!

124
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,430
No!

125
00:10:55,513 --> 00:10:56,620
He cut me?

126
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:04,053
But he doesn't have a blade, and I
couldn't see his line of attack at all.

127
00:11:05,100 --> 00:11:07,460
How the hell does his power work?

128
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:17,830
Luffy!

129
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:24,660
Damn, you busted their asses.

130
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:25,740
That was easy.

131
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:33,480
This is bad.

132
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:34,959
We gotta get away.

133
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:37,097
Don't just stand there, you goons.

134
00:11:37,180 --> 00:11:38,237
You got them on the ropes.

135
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:40,140
Now hurry and finish the job.

136
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:43,280
You want to be a part
of the Tomi Robo or not?

137
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:45,260
Get to work!

138
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:48,280
We can't take a beating here.

139
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,540
Not like this.

140
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:56,380
We need every ounce of strength for Kaido.

141
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:59,485
They've got us outnumbered,
but that's not all.

142
00:12:00,300 --> 00:12:01,720
They're strong, too.

143
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:03,460
I've got you now!

144
00:12:09,820 --> 00:12:10,940
I'm good now.

145
00:12:11,180 --> 00:12:12,533
Sorry about that, Zoro.

146
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,300
You better be.

147
00:12:15,260 --> 00:12:17,537
There's no point in wearing
these anymore, right?

148
00:12:17,620 --> 00:12:18,840
I guess not.

149
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:20,962
They're too constricting anyway.

150
00:12:21,140 --> 00:12:22,081
All right, then.

151
00:12:24,940 --> 00:12:26,260
No holding back.

152
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,365
We got to break through quick.

153
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,580
You got it.

154
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,520
You think it's that easy?

155
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:36,760
As long as you're in my range,
I can mess you up. Check it out.

156
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:39,340
So how do we fight that?

157
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:41,170
Scratch.

158
00:12:45,260 --> 00:12:46,200
Kid, stop!

159
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:47,893
You'll blow your cover!

160
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:02,820
Let them know I'm here!

161
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:12,220
You're going to pay, filthy train.

162
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:18,040
So much suffering, and
I owe it all to you.

163
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:25,600
I'll see you in hell, Aku!

164
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,260
Oh, hell no!

165
00:13:35,260 --> 00:13:36,680
Get down!

166
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,860
It's Jackie!

167
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,200
That idiot!

168
00:14:00,220 --> 00:14:03,060
Hey, wait a second, who is that guy?

169
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:22,800
Oh, hell no! Seriously?

170
00:14:27,260 --> 00:14:30,480
What the shit is Captain Can't do in here?

171
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:37,540
Like Straw Hat wasn't bad enough already.

172
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:40,460
What happened in Udon, Babanuki?

173
00:14:40,940 --> 00:14:42,817
How did you screw this up so bad?

174
00:14:42,900 --> 00:14:44,606
You're making me look stupid!

175
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:59,437
you just couldn't wait
to form that alliance

176
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:05,717
with us could you i made
a mistake i shouldn't

177
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:11,817
have been so trusting i
should have known that

178
00:15:11,900 --> 00:15:14,297
you were working as an
informant for kaido No!

179
00:15:14,380 --> 00:15:17,817
He was ready for us because
he knew every move we'd made,

180
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:21,500
and you were the one responsible for that!

181
00:15:25,540 --> 00:15:29,060
You were screwed from the
start, sucker! Oh, yeah?

182
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:31,617
You thought our alliance was that strong?

183
00:15:31,700 --> 00:15:35,117
Strong enough to take on one
of the Four Emperors that easy?

184
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,780
Get real, you moron!

185
00:15:39,580 --> 00:15:42,057
Pirate alliances are
sketchy to begin with.

186
00:15:42,140 --> 00:15:45,434
You're seriously out here
expecting a happy ending, huh?

187
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:48,120
Well, scratch. Slash.

188
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:05,200
I gotta admit, for such a
chump, you're hard to kill.

189
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:07,360
For all the good it does you.

190
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:11,100
You're a scumbag.

191
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:14,661
Master Queen, we're having
a tough time over here.

192
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:17,917
I don't know if we can
catch these guys alive.

193
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,471
They're way too slippery.

194
00:16:20,820 --> 00:16:22,760
Then they'll have to die.

195
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,070
Repel!

196
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:40,357
Seems like you guys have a death wish!

197
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:43,120
I'd be happy to let go ahead!

198
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,060
There he is!

199
00:16:48,180 --> 00:16:49,415
I knew it was killer!

200
00:17:05,100 --> 00:17:06,120
Come on, kid!

201
00:17:06,520 --> 00:17:07,920
We gotta pack it up!

202
00:17:09,600 --> 00:17:12,777
Fighting these thugs isn't
going to accomplish anything.

203
00:17:12,860 --> 00:17:15,213
There's no end to them, that's for sure.

204
00:17:21,740 --> 00:17:22,940
Hey, stay back!

205
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:27,321
Even if you kill them, they won't
let you be part of the Toby Robo!

206
00:17:41,340 --> 00:17:42,540
Whoa, stop!

207
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:43,760
You'll hit us!

208
00:17:52,900 --> 00:17:54,660
Get away from me!

209
00:17:56,560 --> 00:17:58,100
Somebody stop him!

210
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:04,140
No way I'm sticking around
for this mess. So long! Peace!

211
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,677
Is that guy part of Kaido's crew?

212
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:08,540
He's going completely nuts

213
00:18:30,120 --> 00:18:31,780
Keep smashing Archer

214
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:37,590
Ah!

215
00:18:42,100 --> 00:18:45,420
Sure would be a shame if
someone shot you in the back!

216
00:18:57,940 --> 00:18:58,840
Let's go!

217
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:00,860
Make a dash for the castle!

218
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:12,140
Ugh, dumb Jaggy.

219
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:16,140
I knew you'd cause a scene as
soon as you ran off. Grow up!

220
00:19:16,320 --> 00:19:18,857
I don't think you have any
room to talk, honestly.

221
00:19:18,940 --> 00:19:21,840
Yeah, and the save goes for you, Round.

222
00:19:22,860 --> 00:19:24,331
Those three are hopeless.

223
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:28,000
Running from the fight?

224
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:30,880
Not a chance when I got you in my side.

225
00:19:31,120 --> 00:19:33,497
My fighting music's gonna knock you flat.

226
00:19:33,580 --> 00:19:34,797
One more round.

227
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:37,400
I'll break it down, check it out!

228
00:19:38,380 --> 00:19:39,960
Hey, cover your ears!

229
00:20:08,380 --> 00:20:10,140
I think I figured it out.

230
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:13,677
A pooh's attacks are only
effective within earshot,

231
00:20:13,760 --> 00:20:16,466
but once you hear him,
it's too late to dodge.

232
00:20:17,060 --> 00:20:18,840
He's fast, so be ready.

233
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:20,940
Huh? What?

234
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:25,800
Well, it's really important,
so listen close. No problem.

235
00:20:26,860 --> 00:20:27,960
Mama, mama.

236
00:20:30,460 --> 00:20:33,177
I just got word from my dear children.

237
00:20:33,260 --> 00:20:38,900
They said their ship is still in working
order, so they'll be here soon. But wait.

238
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:42,336
If they're that close, we
should have heard something.

239
00:20:42,420 --> 00:20:46,244
They have to pass through Mogura
port to enter the island safely.

240
00:20:49,580 --> 00:20:50,737
At the port?

241
00:20:50,820 --> 00:20:51,860
There's a port.

242
00:20:52,980 --> 00:20:53,810
What?

243
00:20:54,320 --> 00:20:57,197
The eastern forces led
by Kin'emon are heading

244
00:20:57,280 --> 00:20:59,337
towards the back entrance of the castle.

245
00:20:59,420 --> 00:21:01,197
Everything is proceeding
according to plan.

246
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:02,540
Listen well.

247
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:05,407
I believe we should
modify our plan somewhat.

248
00:21:05,840 --> 00:21:07,657
Not only have we made steady progress,

249
00:21:07,740 --> 00:21:11,211
but it seems that the enemy
has yet to notice our presence.

250
00:21:11,980 --> 00:21:14,568
Therefore, we should
split in two yet again.

251
00:21:15,820 --> 00:21:17,917
The first group will
sneak in from the side of

252
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:20,477
the Skull Dome and wait
inside for the time being.

253
00:21:20,560 --> 00:21:24,137
Thanks to our disguises, you should
be able to blend in quite easily.

254
00:21:24,220 --> 00:21:27,737
Meanwhile, the second group will sneak
in from the back entrance of the castle.

255
00:21:27,820 --> 00:21:31,197
Once we're both in position,
we can launch a pincer attack.

256
00:21:31,280 --> 00:21:33,160
There's a lot riding on this.

257
00:21:33,900 --> 00:21:36,076
I wonder if Momo's there with Orochi.

258
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:43,920
Thus, after a few alterations, the
prime continues to progress smoothly.

259
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:50,120
One moment.

260
00:21:51,380 --> 00:21:54,780
Suddenly, they encounter
an unexpected complication.

261
00:21:55,300 --> 00:21:56,440
What a pity.

262
00:21:56,840 --> 00:21:59,577
The information on the
blueprints was out of date.

263
00:21:59,660 --> 00:22:01,120
The base has expanded.

264
00:22:01,280 --> 00:22:02,500
This part is new.

265
00:22:02,900 --> 00:22:07,900
But if 2,000 soldiers try to cross that
bridge, we'll draw far too much attention.

266
00:22:11,860 --> 00:22:13,742
Hey, what are you talking about?

267
00:22:15,280 --> 00:22:17,420
